{
 "id": "companions/brannoc_tallow",
 "start": "greet",
 "_comment": "Brannoc Tallow, 34, a robber of the Ashen Hand spared on the road (Yield). Recruit by parole at the Ashford inn board. Flags: docs/regions/COMPANIONS_R1.md.",
 "nodes": {
  "greet": {
   "speaker": "brannoc_tallow",
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Hands where you can see them. That's manners, where I come from. Roads, mostly.",
     "if": {
      "no_flag": "companion.brannoc_tallow.recruit_yes"
     },
     "p": 1
    },
    {
     "text": "Don't come up behind me. I'd rather not find out what I'd do.",
     "if": {
      "time": "night",
      "no_flag": "companion.brannoc_tallow.recruit_yes"
     },
     "p": 2
    },
    {
     "text": "Lead on. I'll count the exits so you don't have to.",
     "if": {
      "flag": "companion.brannoc_tallow.recruit_yes",
      "no_flag": "companion.brannoc_tallow.done"
     },
     "p": 2
    },
    {
     "text": "Mab's in Captain Hollis's cells and I slept all night. Nobody warned me that was possible.",
     "if": {
      "flag": "companion.brannoc_tallow.path_law"
     },
     "p": 3
    },
    {
     "text": "Mab's ledger is ash. I'm not sure I'm proud. Walk on. I'll sort it out later.",
     "if": {
      "flag": "companion.brannoc_tallow.path_quiet"
     },
     "p": 3
    },
    {
     "text": "You keep turning up. I've stopped pretending to be surprised.",
     "if": {
      "flag": "companion.brannoc_tallow.courting"
     },
     "p": 4
    },
    {
     "text": "Friends. Good. I've been poor at it. I'd like to get better, with you.",
     "if": {
      "flag": "companion.brannoc_tallow.friends_only"
     },
     "p": 4
    }
   ],
   "choices": [
    {
     "text": "Who are you?",
     "goto": "bio",
     "if": {
      "no_flag": "companion.brannoc_tallow.recruit_yes"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "Walk with me. On parole.",
     "goto": "recruit",
     "if": {
      "no_flag": "companion.brannoc_tallow.recruit_yes"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "Tell me about Hollin's Reach.",
     "goto": "reach",
     "if": {
      "flag": "companion.brannoc_tallow.recruit_yes"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "About that favour you mentioned...",
     "goto": "favour_open",
     "if": {
      "flag": "companion.brannoc_tallow.recruit_yes",
      "no_flag": "companion.brannoc_tallow.done"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "Is there something between us?",
     "goto": "courtship",
     "if": {
      "flag": [
       "companion.brannoc_tallow.done",
       "hero.female"
      ],
      "no_flag": [
       "companion.brannoc_tallow.courting",
       "companion.brannoc_tallow.friends_only"
      ]
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "Good day.",
     "goto": "@end"
    }
   ]
  },
  "bio": {
   "speaker": "brannoc_tallow",
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Brannoc Tallow. Thirty-four. Eleven years of the Ashen Hand, and one afternoon of you putting me in the dirt."
    }
   ],
   "choices": [
    {
     "text": "And then?",
     "goto": "bio_2"
    }
   ]
  },
  "bio_2": {
   "speaker": "brannoc_tallow",
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "I was fifteen the winter Hollin's Reach went outside the ward. Forty graves. The Hand turned up with soup."
    }
   ],
   "choices": [
    {
     "text": "Why tell me?",
     "goto": "bio_3"
    }
   ]
  },
  "bio_3": {
   "speaker": "brannoc_tallow",
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Because you spared me, and I owe that to someone. A robber knows every road and every back door. I'm cheap."
    }
   ],
   "choices": [
    {
     "text": "Walk with me. On parole.",
     "goto": "recruit",
     "if": {
      "no_flag": "companion.brannoc_tallow.recruit_yes"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "I will think on it.",
     "goto": "@end"
    }
   ]
  },
  "recruit": {
   "speaker": "brannoc_tallow",
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Terms: no wage, a tenth of what we take, and you hang me yourself if I run. Ashford's cells are worse than the road."
    }
   ],
   "choices": [
    {
     "text": "Those are fair terms.",
     "goto": "recruit_yes"
    },
    {
     "text": "Not yet.",
     "goto": "recruit_no"
    }
   ]
  },
  "recruit_yes": {
   "speaker": "brannoc_tallow",
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Then I'm yours till the debt's paid. Mind: I'll never fight a man who's already down. Hand rules, even for the Hand."
    }
   ],
   "choices": [
    {
     "text": "Walk with me.",
     "goto": "@end",
     "do": [
      [
       "flag",
       "companion.brannoc_tallow.recruit_yes"
      ]
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  "recruit_no": {
   "speaker": "brannoc_tallow",
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Take your time. I'm not going anywhere. Parole, remember. Mostly parole."
    }
   ],
   "choices": [
    {
     "text": "I will.",
     "goto": "@end"
    }
   ]
  },
  "favour_open": {
   "speaker": "brannoc_tallow",
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "The old camp at Duskbriar. The ash there remembers me, and I'd like to know what it remembers about the fence."
    }
   ],
   "choices": [
    {
     "text": "Tell me more.",
     "goto": "favour_2"
    },
    {
     "text": "Another day.",
     "goto": "@end"
    }
   ]
  },
  "favour_2": {
   "speaker": "brannoc_tallow",
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Mab Larkin. She bought what we took and sold on to a hand that wrote neat. Nobody in the Hand writes neat."
    }
   ],
   "choices": [
    {
     "text": "I will see to it.",
     "goto": "@end",
     "do": [
      [
       "flag",
       "companion.brannoc_tallow.quest_asked"
      ],
      [
       "quests"
      ]
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  "courtship": {
   "speaker": "brannoc_tallow",
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "There's a thing I haven't said. You make a man want to be someone his mother wouldn't have to apologise for."
    }
   ],
   "choices": [
    {
     "text": "I'd like to walk beside you. Properly.",
     "goto": "court_yes"
    },
    {
     "text": "Friends is plenty.",
     "goto": "court_friends"
    },
    {
     "text": "Not now.",
     "goto": "@end"
    }
   ]
  },
  "court_yes": {
   "speaker": "brannoc_tallow",
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Slow is fine. I've done fast. Fast ends in ditches."
    }
   ],
   "choices": [
    {
     "text": "Then we go slowly.",
     "goto": "@end",
     "do": [
      [
       "flag",
       "companion.brannoc_tallow.courting"
      ]
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  "court_friends": {
   "speaker": "brannoc_tallow",
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Plenty. I've had less and called it plenty before. This time I mean it."
    }
   ],
   "choices": [
    {
     "text": "Friends.",
     "goto": "@end",
     "do": [
      [
       "flag",
       "companion.brannoc_tallow.friends_only"
      ]
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  "reach": {
   "speaker": "brannoc_tallow",
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "A hundred and ten souls and a mill. The Crown pulled the ward-line back a mile. It didn't tell anyone."
    }
   ],
   "choices": [
    {
     "text": "Who did you lose?",
     "goto": "reach_2"
    }
   ]
  },
  "reach_2": {
   "speaker": "brannoc_tallow",
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "My sister, Pell. Nine. We kept her warm with every coat in the house. The dark doesn't care about coats."
    }
   ],
   "choices": [
    {
     "text": "I'm sorry.",
     "goto": "@end",
     "do": [
      [
       "flag",
       "companion.brannoc_tallow.told_reach"
      ]
     ]
    }
   ]
  }
 }
}
